(SUMMARY) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A single authoritative OTP gen_server implements account registration,) Tj T*
(subreddit membership, text posts and reposts, hierarchical comments,) Tj T*
(upvotes/downvotes and karma, feeds, and direct messages with replies.) Tj T*
(Two independent client BEAM OS processes simulate concurrent users.) Tj T*
(All application, testing, benchmarking, PDF and ZIP tooling uses Erlang/OTP.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Largest population tested: 50000 simulated users) Tj T*
(Largest population meeting the configured SLO: 20000 users) Tj T*
(Completed benchmark runs: 11) Tj T*
(Sweep elapsed: 562 s; configured budget: 900 s) Tj T*
(Stop reason:) Tj T*
(Completion, timeout, latency or sustained mailbox-growth criterion failed.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Final probe: 50000 users, p95 upper bound 4096 ms; SLO passed: false) Tj T*
(The final probe missed the configured SLO; consult latency and outcome rows.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The largest tested population is not a claim about an absolute system limit.) Tj T*
(All numbers in this report are derived from the supplied JSON evidence.) Tj T*
(The report PDF is deliberately excluded from project4.zip.) Tj T*
ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 270 30 Td (1 / 7) Tj ET
endstream
