(VALIDATION, LIMITATIONS AND REPRODUCTION) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Validation:) Tj T*
(13 EUnit tests cover registration, membership, arbitrary nested comments,) Tj T*
(cross-post parent rejection, vote replacement/removal and karma, multi-feed) Tj T*
(pagination, reposts, inbox privacy, offline delivery, invalid operations,) Tj T*
(exact Zipf member counts and histogram percentiles. A distributed demo tests) Tj T*
(the features across two OS processes, 50 concurrent identical votes,) Tj T*
(offline/reconnect, an unresponsive request and an unavailable engine node.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Runtime for the representative run:) Tj T*
(OTP 29; architecture aarch64-apple-darwin; available logical CPUs 8) Tj T*
(Schedulers per engine/client node: 2) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Install Erlang/OTP 27+ \(OTP 29.1.2 was used here\). No Hex, Rebar, Gleam,) Tj T*
(Python, database, web server or external PDF library is required.) Tj T*
(Run from the extracted project directory:) Tj T*
(  escript scripts/project4.escript test) Tj T*
(  escript scripts/project4.escript demo) Tj T*
(  escript scripts/project4.escript simulate --users 1000) Tj T*
(  escript scripts/project4.escript benchmark --output results/new-sweep) Tj T*
(  escript scripts/project4.escript report --input results/new-sweep) Tj T*
(  escript scripts/project4.escript package) Tj T*
(Output directories must be new; existing evidence is not overwritten.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Limitations: all engine data is in memory. Restart resets it. A single state) Tj T*
(server serializes engine operations and limits throughput. These are local) Tj T*
(loopback measurements with fixed text payloads, brief windows and no disk) Tj T*
(durability, authentication, HTTP/WebSocket traffic or browser clients.) Tj T*
(Memory is sampled BEAM allocated memory, not OS resident-set size. CPU is) Tj T*
(BEAM runtime CPU time between the first and last measurement-window samples.) Tj T*
(Sampling can miss short peaks; scheduler counts are capped to avoid laptop) Tj T*
(oversubscription. Seeds reproduce workload choices, not interleaving/timing.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Evidence directory:) Tj T*
(/Users/hkarimkonda/Documents/dosp_project_4.1/results/erlang-benchmark) Tj T*
() Tj T*
